  </ul>

  <h2>The bottom line</h2>
  <p>Adding web data to n8n does not need a special node or a custom service — it needs an HTTP Request node and a key. Firecrawl fits that slot for markdown; Ollagraph fits the same slot and extends it to structured data, domain intelligence, and vertical actors, behind one bearer token and a flat, refundable bill. Start with 1,000 free credits and no card, wire the scrape workflow above in five minutes, and read the request shapes for every endpoint in the <a href="/docs">docs</a> — or compare the full surface on the <a href="/vs/firecrawl">Ollagraph vs Firecrawl</a> page.</p>
